                "Apron-3 is already pinned to Gull-Pontoon GP-5 with both hydraulic rams at "
                "8.2 MPa, 2.8 MPa shy of the 11.0 MPa cylinder stop. Tide at the staff is a "
                "separate 2.40 m reading under a 3.50 m freeboard mark and is not a ram quantity. "
                "The planned 0.08 m/s raise is legal on the ram numbers. The supervisor nonetheless "
                "zeros the raise, spending the tide staff as if it were cylinder over-travel.",